# Reference-typed `static readonly` fields across SEPARATE packages. The
# producer emits value-globals nullable so the `ref.null` initializer
# validates; the consumer must declare the import the same way, because the
# engine's import check is invariant on the content type of a mutable global.
# `static_cross_package` only covers `number`, which has no nullability bit to
# disagree on.
# name          dir    deps          root
@test/strx      strx   -
main            app    @test/strx    root
